"P814681688" "All the signs point to a massive Council strike in the works, but we've got no details whatsoever. Fortunately, I've located a Council base that has been operating as a communications hub for the last several months. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can infiltrate that base, I'm sure we can learn something.</a> In fact, we may learn more than we want to know."
