"P3032843927" "Ok, {HeroName}, you've done the prep work, now the real task is ahead. You've got to go into the Mount Richardson base itself! I need info, kid, and I hope you can find it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Take on some of the patrols inside the base and see if you can learn anything about this plan of Archon Burkholder's.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P258261587" "Take on patrols inside Mount Richardson base"
// SendOffString :
"P4205382914" "I don't expect this task to be a cake walk, and neither should you. Go prepared, and don't go alone."
