"P2269694786" "After defeating Archon Parson, you found a note in your pocket."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3956308735" "Well, you didn't nab Burkholder, but that note you found may be the key to catching him. We may have to make a call on this Ernesto Hess. But take my advice, {HeroName}: don't trust this man too far. He says he's been working with the Council for years; that means he's done some pretty wicked things. Listen to him, but be on your guard."
// RandomFameString :
"P1713858691" "I hear {HeroName} has a contact within the Council!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1805228917" "That note you found has got me wondering. Who is this Ernesto Hess? Why does he want to betray the Council, if he's truly served in it for years? I don't understand any of this, but I think we have to take the chance that he's telling the truth. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you go speak to this Ernesto Hess?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2523023444" "Speak to Ernesto Hess"
// SendOffString :
"P2825767323" "Hess may be leading you into a trap. Be prepared."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2717145430" "We need to know what game this Hess is playing at."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1466364941" "<color deepskyblue>Part Six</color>"

